  "limitations": "The theorem assumes a fixed alphabet size and uniform i.i.d. letters. The O((log n)^2) remainder uses the uniform fixed-level approximation of Gheorghiciuc--Ward (2007); the next logarithmic-order phase term, nonuniform sources, variance and concentration are not treated. Originality is to the best of our knowledge; older trie/suffix-tree profile theorems may contain an equivalent periodic expansion. No independent validation is asserted.",
